@startuml seq-game-over
' 시계 tick → 한 세대 진행 → 암세포 게임 종료 → 결과 창
' 기준: refactor/base ef8ee24.
' application/UtilTimerTickSource.java, application/Clock.java:60-61, ui/ModeSwitch.java:102-108,
' ui/ClassicMode.java:28, application/GameController.java:75-99, ui/GameResultAnnouncer.java, ui/SwingUserDialogs.java
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

box "Timer 스레드" #F2F2F2
participant "UtilTimerTickSource" as Ticks
participant "Clock" as Clock
participant "ModeSwitch" as Modes
participant "ClassicMode" as Classic
participant "GameController" as Controller
participant "CompositeBoard\n(Board)" as Board
participant "CancerGame" as Cancer
participant "BoardPanel\n(GameListener)" as Panel
participant "GameResultAnnouncer\n(GameListener)" as Announcer
end box
box "Swing 이벤트 스레드 (EDT)" #E8F0FF
participant "SwingUserDialogs" as Dialogs
participant "JOptionPane" as Pane
end box

Ticks -> Clock : tick()
Clock -> Modes : tick()  (Clock.Listener)
note right of Modes : 메뉴가 열려 있으면 건너뜀\n(GameMenu.menuIsActive)
Modes -> Classic : tick()  [synchronized(tickLock)]
Classic -> Controller : tick()
activate Controller
group synchronized(lock)
  Controller -> Board : step()
  Board --> Controller : changed
  Controller -> Cancer : afterGeneration()
  Cancer --> Controller : ended = true (승리 또는 패배)
end
opt changed
  Controller -> Panel : boardChanged(GENERATION)
  Panel -> Panel : refreshNow()  (invokeLater로 부분 갱신)
end
Controller -> Panel : boardChanged(EDITED)
Panel -> Panel : repaint()
Controller -> Announcer : boardChanged(EDITED)
note right of Announcer : GAME_OVER가 아니면 무시 (UI-R18)
Controller -> Clock : stop()
Controller -> Panel : boardChanged(GAME_OVER)
note right of Panel : 무시
Controller -> Announcer : boardChanged(GAME_OVER)
activate Announcer
Announcer -> Controller : gameResultMessage()
Controller --> Announcer : "…승리입니다." / "…패배입니다."
Announcer ->> Dialogs : onUiThread.execute(...)\n(제품: SwingUtilities.invokeLater, 009)
deactivate Announcer
deactivate Controller

Dialogs -> Pane : showMessageDialog(LifeFrame, message,\n"Game of Life", INFORMATION_MESSAGE)
@enduml
